data: {"id": "f045999c9c3a43c7-thinking-parallel_evidence-2216", "run_id": "f045999c9c3a43c7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1.  **Pod 身份与生命周期**\n    *   Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 当前状态为 **Pending**，卡在 **ContainerCreating** 阶段，持续了超过 70 分钟。\n    *   Pod 调度在 `node2`，`restarts=0`，表明该容器从未成功启动过。\n    *   Metrics 确认 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason: `ContainerCreating`)，且无重启记录。\n\n2.  **根因事件与配置证据 (Kubernetes)**\n    *   **描述 (Describe)** 指出 Pod 停滞的直接原因是 **缺少 NetworkAttachmentDefinition**。\n    *   注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks` 引用了名为 `unavailable-network` 的网络定义，但在 `aiops-case-05` ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788432355322, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "f045999c9c3a43c7-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "f045999c9c3a43c7", "seq": 2217, "ts_ms": 1788432361850, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 44.511, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/f045999c9c3a43c7-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "56421fa1aa0d6452074fd2c99881cdb5d2c349fc461b3b7d65c823a66abc089f", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "9790ba1be9eca0191664be4fd38f869994e498987f7104f0c393ad76a9db8fce"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "f045999c9c3a43c7-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "f045999c9c3a43c7", "seq": 2218, "ts_ms": 1788432361850, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "f045999c9c3a43c7-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "f045999c9c3a43c7", "seq": 2219, "ts_ms": 1788432372719, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.869, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 2176, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network'，导致 Multus CNI 插件无法配置网络，Pod 无限期卡在 ContainerCreating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed to create pod sandbox: ... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add): Multus: ... error loading k8s delegates k8s args: TryLoadPodDelegates: error in getting k8s network for pod: GetNetworkDelegates: failed getting the delegate: getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact-10849248dfe8) | 明确展示了 kubelet 调用 Multus 插件失败的详细调用链与缺失资源对象，指向根因 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning NoNetworkFound multus cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (fact-01e4ee82b165, fact-081eb57ffc71 等) | 在 pod 启动的长时间窗口内持续触发同一错误事件，证明故障持续存在且未自愈 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `ContainerCreating` 状态，reason: `ContainerCreating` (fact-2a27f02d4951) | 确认 Pod 当前处于等待配置网络的阻塞状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1`，labels: `reason=ContainerCreating` (fact-00d78e74e767) | 确认集群中该 Pod 处于 Waiting 状态的客观计量数据，与状态一致 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 的 State 与 Metric 数据一致确认 Pod 处于等待状态。所有诊断价值集中于 K8s Event，kubelet 层面的 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误（#1）包含了深层的 Multus 代理调用失败详情，而高频的 `NoNetworkFound` 警告（#2）证实了该依赖资源的长期缺失，两者结合直接锁定了故障源头。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n引用不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus 插件尝试加载网络代理配置失败 → Pod 沙箱创建失败 (Sandbox creation failed) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 配置了引用 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus 网络依赖，但目标 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 对象在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。这一配置缺陷导致 Multus CNI 插件在执行网络配置时抛出 `not found` 错误，致使 Pod 无法完成网络沙箱建立，从而无限期阻塞在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。该结论由详细的 Event 日志调用链（事实 #1、#2）和容器状态数据（事实 #3）相互印证。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v 引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network'，导致 Multus CNI 插件无法配置网络，Pod 无限期卡在 ContainerCreating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed to create pod sandbox: ... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add): Multus: ... error loading k8s delegates k8s args: TryLoadPodDelegates: error in getting k8s network for pod: GetNetworkDelegates: failed getting the delegate: getKubernetesDelegate: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact-10849248dfe8) | 明确展示了 kubelet 调用 Multus 插件失败的详细调用链与缺失资源对象，指向根因 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning NoNetworkFound multus cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (fact-01e4ee82b165, fact-081eb57ffc71 等) | 在 pod 启动的长时间窗口内持续触发同一错误事件，证明故障持续存在且未自愈 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `ContainerCreating` 状态，reason: `ContainerCreating` (fact-2a27f02d4951) | 确认 Pod 当前处于等待配置网络的阻塞状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1`，labels: `reason=ContainerCreating` (fact-00d78e74e767) | 确认集群中该 Pod 处于 Waiting 状态的客观计量数据，与状态一致 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 的 State 与 Metric 数据一致确认 Pod 处于等待状态。所有诊断价值集中于 K8s Event，kubelet 层面的 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误（#1）包含了深层的 Multus 代理调用失败详情，而高频的 `NoNetworkFound` 警告（#2）证实了该依赖资源的长期缺失，两者结合直接锁定了故障源头。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n引用不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus 插件尝试加载网络代理配置失败 → Pod 沙箱创建失败 (Sandbox creation failed) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 配置了引用 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus 网络依赖，但目标 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 对象在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。这一配置缺陷导致 Multus CNI 插件在执行网络配置时抛出 `not found` 错误，致使 Pod 无法完成网络沙箱建立，从而无限期阻塞在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。该结论由详细的 Event 日志调用链（事实 #1、#2）和容器状态数据（事实 #3）相互印证。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

