在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 配置了引用 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus 网络依赖，但目标 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 对象在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。这一配置缺陷导致 Multus CNI 插件在执行网络配置时抛出 `not found` 错误，致使 Pod 无法完成网络沙箱建立，从而无限期阻塞在 `ContainerCreating` 状态。该结论由详细的 Event 日志调用链（事实 #1、#2）和容器状态数据（事实 #3）相互印证。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 48.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 44.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v: 44.5s (Evidence 38.1s, RCA 6.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v**: pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 103.635, "metrics": {"run_id": "f045999c9c3a43c7", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 103.6440999507904, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "47%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"nam